        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>第四节 条件致病菌 笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #d8dfe0;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(120,160,170,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(120,160,170,0.35) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 13px 13px;\n    background-color: #f4f6f2;\n    border: 1px solid #b9c2c0;\n    padding: 18px 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* vertical Chinese writing, right-to-left columns */\n  .sheet {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    height: 280px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    color: #1b3a86;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .sheet.lower { height: 320px; }\n  .binding {\n    height: 42px;\n    margin: 10px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .binding .placeholder {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 40px;\n    border: 1px dashed #8a8f8c;\n    color: #555;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #e7ecea;\n    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n  }\n  .red { color: #c0392b; }\n  .pink { color: #d63384; }\n  .boxed-red {\n    border: 1.5px solid #c0392b;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .boxed-pink {\n    border: 1.5px solid #d63384;\n    color: #d63384;\n    padding: 2px 3px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .dots { color: #c0392b; letter-spacing: 3px; }\n  .arrow { color: #d63384; }\n  .heading { font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; }\n  .indent { margin-top: 14px; }\n  .placeholder.dotline {\n    writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1px dashed #c0392b;\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <!-- ===== Upper half of the notebook page (vertical columns, right to left) ===== -->\n  <div class=\"sheet upper\">\n    <p>三、防治原则</p>\n    <p>及溶血素、青霉素等。可用抗生素<br>治疗，如青霉素、红霉素。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"heading\">第四节 奈瑟菌属</p>\n\n    <p>一、脑膜炎奈瑟菌</p>\n    <p>俗称脑膜炎球菌。</p>\n    <p>是流行性脑脊髓膜炎的病原菌。</p>\n\n    <p>（一）生物学性状</p>\n    <p>1. 形态与染色</p>\n    <p>革兰阴性双球菌，肾形或豆形，<br>凹面相对成双排列。</p>\n    <p class=\"boxed-red\">在脑脊液中性粒细胞内、外</p>\n    <p>2. 培养特性</p>\n    <p>营养要求高，需在含血清或血液等培养<br>基中生长。专性需氧。</p>\n    <p>3. 生化反应</p>\n    <p>大多能分解葡萄糖和麦芽糖，产酸不产气。</p>\n    <p>4. 抗原构造与分类</p>\n    <p>依据荚膜多糖抗原将其分为多个血清群。</p>\n    <p>5. 抵抗力</p>\n    <p>对理化因素抵抗力弱，对干燥、热、<br>寒冷及一般消毒剂均敏感。</p>\n    <p>产生自身溶解酶，<span class=\"pink\">易发生自溶</span>。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"dots\">• • • • • •</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"boxed-pink\">无鞭毛、无芽孢<br>有荚膜和菌毛</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"boxed-pink\">脑脊液涂片是重要的<br>检查方法</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"boxed-pink\">迅速死亡，采集标本<br>后应立即送检、保温</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== Spiral binding zone ===== -->\n  <div class=\"binding\">\n    <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 笔记本螺旋线圈装订，横贯页面中部]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== Lower half of the notebook page ===== -->\n  <div class=\"sheet lower\">\n    <p>（一）致病性</p>\n    <p>1. 致病物质</p>\n    <p>（1）荚膜：有抗吞噬作用，能增强细菌的侵<br>袭力。</p>\n    <p>（2）菌毛：可黏附于宿主呼吸道黏膜上皮细胞的表面。</p>\n    <p>（3）内毒素：主要致病物质，<br>可引起发热、微循环障碍及<br>DIC 等。</p>\n    <p>（4）IgA1 蛋白酶：破坏黏膜表面的 sIgA，<br>有利于细菌黏附于细胞表面。</p>\n    <p>2. 所致疾病</p>\n    <p>流行性脑脊髓膜炎（流脑）。</p>\n    <p>人是唯一的易感宿主。</p>\n    <p>6 个月至 2 岁婴儿及儿<br>童易感。</p>\n    <p>经飞沫传播，<span class=\"pink\">冬春季</span>发病<br>率较高。</p>\n    <p>（二）免疫性</p>\n    <p>以体液免疫为主，可获得<br>牢固免疫力。</p>\n\n    <p>（三）微生物学检查法</p>\n    <p>1. 标本采集<br>采集脑脊液、血液或皮肤瘀点<br>渗出物，注意保温、立即送检。</p>\n    <p>2. 直接涂片镜检<br>脑脊液离心沉淀后涂片染色<br>镜检，找到革兰阴性双球菌<br>有诊断价值。</p>\n    <p>3. 分离培养与鉴定<br>接种于巧克力色血琼脂平板，<br>置 5%~10% CO₂ 环境中培养。</p>\n    <p>4. 快速诊断<br>用对流免疫电泳、ELISA 等方法<br>检测标本中的抗原。</p>\n\n    <p>（四）防治原则<br>1. 隔离治疗病人，早期发现、<br>早期隔离、早期治疗。</p>\n    <p>2. 注射荚膜多糖疫苗进行特异性预防。</p>\n    <p>3. 治疗药物为首选青霉素 G，亦可<br>选用磺胺类药物、氯霉素等。</p>\n\n    <p><span class=\"boxed-pink\">该菌营养要求高，常用巧克力色<br>血琼脂平板培养</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"boxed-pink\">易普遍型约占 90%，上呼吸道炎型</span></p>\n    <p><span class=\"arrow\">←</span> <span class=\"pink\">头痛、呕吐等症状，颈项强直等</span></p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- ===== bottom-left small marking on the page ===== -->\n  <div class=\"placeholder dotline\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">[Mark: 页面左下角标签，字迹不清 [illegible]]</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
